OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry, bright and sunny start
OL,6,Fto the day with blue skies. Cloud will
OL,7,Fincrease during the afternoon with a
OL,8,Ffew showery outbreaks of rain
OL,9,Fpossible. Feeling very warm in the
OL,10,Fsunshine, though breezy.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FLargely dry with patchy cloud
OL,13,Fthis evening, although a few spots of
OL,14,Frain are possible. Further outbreaks
OL,15,Fof light rain are possible overnight.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FA cloudy and wet start to the
OL,18,Fday with brisk winds. Rain will ease a
OL,19,Flittle into the afternoon, becoming
OL,20,Fmore showery with a chance of brighter
OL,21,Fspells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
