OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FLargely dry through the start of next
OL,7,Fweek, Plenty of sunny spells, and a
OL,8,Fsmall chance of a few showers on
OL,9,FMonday and Tuesday. Turning warmer as
OL,10,Fthe week progresses.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
